{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-10-25 11:45:00', 'title': 'LINDE PLC: LINDE DECLARES DIVIDEND IN FOURTH QUARTER 2021', 'text': 'GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / OCTOBER 25, 2021 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN); (FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.06 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 17, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 3, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-10-25 11:00:00', 'title': 'LINDE BOARD ELECTS TWO NEW DIRECTORS AND ADDS SUSTAINABILITY COMMITTEE', 'text': 'GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / OCTOBER 25, 2021 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED JOE KAESER AND ALBERTO WEISSER AS NEW DIRECTORS OF LINDE PLC, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 1, 2021. KAESER WILL SERVE ON THE NOMINATION AND GOVERNANCE AND THE HUMAN CAPITAL COMMITTEES, AND WEISSER WILL SERVE ON THE AUDIT AND THE SUSTAINABILITY COMMITTEES.'}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-10-25 10:50:00', 'title': 'LINDE PLC ANNOUNCES CEO AND CHAIRMAN SUCCESSION', 'text': "GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / OCTOBER 25, 2021 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN); (FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPOINTED SANJIV LAMBA TO SUCCEED STEVE ANGEL AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND STEVE ANGEL TO SUCCEED WOLFGANG REITZLE AS CHAIRMAN, EFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 2022. LAMBA WAS NAMED LINDE'S CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER IN OCTOBER 2020."}